NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — communication-avalanche (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:11.908
<v Narrator>Na farko, daga microbes na gargajiya zuwa AI na yau da kullun, kungiyoyi suna girma ta hanyar raba alamun a kan iyakoki masu tsauri da ƙofa masu aminci.

2
00:00:11.988 --> 00:00:20.888
<v Narrator>Na biyu, al'amari-dauke wakeups da signed duba hana mummunan gyara da bayar da mafi yawa tabbatarwa aiki per joule.

3
00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:32.990
<v Narrator>Na uku, hanyoyi goma na AI suna haɗuwa ta hanyar ayyuka masu ƙarancin ƙira, yayin da hanyoyin kwakwalwa na gaba ke zama a kan tushe cikin yarda mai tsauri.
